    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13827" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποστέγ-ω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shelter</i> or <i>protect,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ὀφρύες ἀ., οἷον ἀπογείσωμα, τῶν
					ὑγρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>PA</u>
					658b16
				</span></i>
			: c. acc. only, <i>protect,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				924b1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καὶ τηρεῖ τὴν ζωήν [ὁ
				φλοιός</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				1.4.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>keep out</i> or <i>off,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὕδωρ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				924a26
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				84.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				844b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ψῦχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					939b17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἁλμυρίδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					3.6.3
				</span></i>
			, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θερμότητα καὶ
			ὑγρότητα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.12.2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.12.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.665f
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄχλον πύργος ἀποστέγει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					234
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πληγὰς λίθων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					6.23.5
				</span></i>
			.</div>
